import pf.Html
import ../Generated/Paths

meta = { title: "Not here · Pomodoro" }

## What a path nothing answers shows (404), and a failure nothing caught (500).
view! = |{ status, problem }|
	<main class="lost">
		<h1>{if (status == 404) "Nothing here" else "Something went wrong"}</h1>
		<p>{if (status == 404) "There is one page here: the timer." else problem}</p>
		<a href={Paths.root}>To the timer</a>
	</main>

<style>
	.lost {
		max-width: 36rem;
		margin: 4rem auto;
		padding: 0 1.25rem;
	}
</style>
